OL,3,GNEWSALong delays as M5 closed after
OL,4,Alorry overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are long delays on the M5 as the
OL,7,Fmotorway is shut in one direction due
OL,8,Fto an overturned lorry.
OL,10,FNational Highways said all three lanes
OL,11,Fwere closed on the northbound
OL,12,Fcarriageway at the Huntworth Bridge at
OL,13,FBridgwater in Somerset, just after
OL,14,Fjunction 24.
OL,16,FThe statement added that emergency
OL,17,Fservices and recovery vehicles were on
OL,18,Fthe scene and there had been "no
OL,19,Finjuries in the incident".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
