OL,3,GNEWSALong delays as M5 closed after
OL,4,Alorry overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe agency said drivers were facing
OL,7,Fnine miles (14.5km) of traffic on the
OL,8,Fapproach and vehicles caught within the
OL,9,Fclosure were being released. It added
OL,10,Fthere were also delays on the
OL,11,Fsouthbound carriageway and on the A38
OL,12,Fin Bridgwater.
